{"text": "Eckels walked into the office of Time Travel. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The big sign on the wall said, NAME ANY YEAR IN THE PAST, WE TAKE YOU THERE. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There was a TV on the wall, and Mister Keith, the new president, was on the news. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> How can we help you, said Mister Parker, the founder of Time Travel. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I have always wanted to see a dinosaur, Is it possible, asked Eckels. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Sure, said Mister Parker, We can take you back to the jungle of 60 million years ago. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Great, said Eckels, Can you take me there now. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You are lucky, There is a time machine that leaves in 10 minutes, said Mister Parker. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> This is Travis, your travel guide, he continued. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To stay safe, you must follow his instructions.", "alignment": {"characters": ["E", "c", "k", "e", "l", "s", " ", "w", "a", "l", "k", "e", "d", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "o", "f", "f", "i", "c", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "T", "i", "m", "e", " ", "T", "r", "a", "v", "e", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "b", "i", "g", " ", "s", "i", "g", "n", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "l", "l", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", ",", " ", "N", "A", "M", "E", " ", "A", "N", "Y", " ", "Y", "E", "A", "R", " ", "I", "N", " ", "T", "H", "E", " ", "P", "A", "S", "T", ",", " ", "W", "E", " ", "T", "A", "K", "E", " ", "Y", "O", "U", " ", "T", "H", "E", "R", "E", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "T", "V", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "l", "l", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "M", "i", "s", "t", "e", "r", " ", "K", "e", "i", "t", "h", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e",